			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.8%;">
			<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">4.1</div>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:2.7%;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:87.5%;">
			<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><a href="ex_906011.htm" style="-sec-extract:exhibit;">Form of Stock Certificate to be issued after January 9, 2026 to represent the Company&#8217;s Common Stock, par value $0.001 per share</a></div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.8%;">
			<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">104</div>
